  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHO COVID-19 Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensuring that people, no matter where they are born, have access to COVID-19 vaccines.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The donation by Kerk in Actie to the Gavi COVAX AMC will:
1) be earmarked for countries in Africa,
2) be only spent on COVID-19 vaccines,
3) will be spent in full by the end of Q1 2022</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The donation to COVAX AMC will go towards purchasing COVID-19  vaccines for 
people in lower income countries on the African continent that are  eligible for 
COVAX AMC support.</narrative>
  </description>
